# Real receipts are photographs of real bills: merchant, date, location, and
# sometimes a card's last four. Synthetic fixtures are generated and safe; these
# are not, and this repo is public. The set stays local; its README does not.
fixtures/receipts/real/*
!fixtures/receipts/real/README.md
